{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30007_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:30a7abd437fc900438e512dd8572c822503e88a9f530bbc5baabcedab4967bf7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24e679ce363a221d7ad8bcaa3abab2e41d86340027302be635c76fc6d25cfd5a",
      "text": "视频正式拍摄中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f95830d21fc0d7be4656a11bfc7bf1df146f502ed211ee0ed29d4fc78d1b462",
      "text": "（很好，第2首歌也顺利结束了。接下来\n只要把第3首歌的舞蹈跳完……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab0ef0ae30d46aef3d5b86eef7ec80b9ec54f4114efdf4dac436d15dfcd2b9df",
      "text": "（第2首歌的时候，感觉自己的动作差点要跟不上大家了……\n第3首歌必须要加油才行！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e861e7ffd9a2f933183b13f72724614808ee847c09ed21cdf809c6848785b487",
      "text": "（好嘞，目前为止感觉都非常棒！\n最后一首也保持这股势头，一定要大获全胜！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a27691130444e482826b7f871442a4c948de4abd7a88303d048aa44ac743139",
      "text": "（……唔！真不愧是大家，太厉害了。\n完全看不出刚才跳了那么久舞蹈练习的疲惫感呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1210f851cf8c5204deb9aa37a800d5704ffa2213c3ecf60c978bfc1fa77c239",
      "text": "（不过，我也有身为最年长者的骨气在。\n必须向大家证明年龄的差距根本算不了什么才行……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4a9ffde73f5bae7f9f6d647a551e6aec317d5252538df68b78d167e79f35ada",
      "text": "（很好，大家的状态似乎都还能坚持。这样的话，\n顺利跳完整首歌应该不成问题）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55aea82c7cbd6e4458d2852fd8cdaa8099dd71ce04869cadea894edd0e3ef0b8",
      "text": "（还剩最后一首！鞋带……看起来没问题！\n拜托了，一定要撑到最后啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:986fce93e532b378b1d56bc0a5d3a1c6dc8f3f555f984683c5ff32ce0e96adf3",
      "text": "……好耶！完美跳到最后啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000215:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ac1ca5beecb800c454c7863874b4e1f262308694c1e4ee5152e008210dd1822",
      "text": "呼……是啊。\n总算是坚持跳完了，太好了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000238:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88f8567f590956572fcf0d95bdc1cbf5e2c80db02aa1ce30f2b7ba2fe5736c3",
      "text": "虽说中途有一瞬间节奏乱了，\n但整体完成度很高。我认为大家跳得非常出色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000245:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08f50c24c4acfa80af1d1e2813b65dcade9e6cbd9916c70f006c6dcd40d68317",
      "text": "太好了，我们全部跳完了哦！\n大家都有好好看着吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000252:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bc59ff72f3e467a875a1f5cfb35c2a31e48e6db08b991d890a56ce570e20193",
      "text": "希望大家能够喜欢这个视频！\n各位，非常感谢一直看到最后的你们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000289:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2a05cd3ee19d5796758b49a46ff8826c647d5dbc0da91a8b7ac69b897638252",
      "text": "也请好好期待下一批成员带来的视频哦。\n再见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000507:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1033caff1fdc9c13dbaa6d678ce27f786061a8e31af6fc13031d68d5f073f053",
      "text": "工作辛苦了，\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000509:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9be9c8a270368b9edcc67c662968227eae573512149e1ef58a41f4458c7250e7",
      "text": "今天终于到了我们视频发布的期待之日啦！\n我从好几天前就开始兴奋得不得了了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000511:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85b46248749c1855c47f9a8be72d4fed113e6cb8300d5cc17e32b53e62f6320c",
      "text": "制作人之前不是说要一起看嘛，\n工作快忙完了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000513:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea500ab837476af986a9ce307cb2ee8d20d6aa91283d30be1b0e3667ebbda82b",
      "text": "马上就结束了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000516:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eda331e6c60d1e63f3d4c31877a09206a0f09702fc2bdf70cc0c49957ad377f",
      "text": "那可太好了！我现在正和龙先生他们往事务所走。\n估计会比预定时间稍微早到一些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000518:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3308260c1195bd8fd62ba214a5fea8951c02b5fc44c56cdc30a7765cf9f80d81",
      "text": "听说其他人也马上就到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000520:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e51913ddff4974390380c9bb698a8da22cc3f80a5e4077745c15885cd06507f2",
      "text": "所以说啊，大家就聊着说要不要去看看\n只有现在才能看到的粉丝们的实时反应。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000522:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53509f7d551953d52eed2650b9a9be8f53fe5f3857e6e631d4b58872b9abd060",
      "text": "那些等着看直播的人，\n现在肯定正因为猜成员而聊得热火朝天吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000524:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8722097764a64068b9e66be0efaddf692334c99d3e4794b1a0a1624551ce830c",
      "text": "只要你手头的工作忙完了就行，\n制作人也一起过来看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000526:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7af85b76a21fb636d7a4d98cb6ccd1ea50128b3f5751e7d902b1ac985258e241",
      "text": "大家也都说想听听你的想法呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000528:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:574b22db2fbfc2f012a2e9c10fff3ab9b20a43c43dfba2ad9a21c9fdbbec244d",
      "text": "……哦，已经到事务所门口了。剩下的见面再当面\n说吧。待会儿见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
